 Y1="0" Y2="15000" Y3="15000"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="78" Lock="false" NumberingType="None" ZOrder="156"><SIZE Height="15000" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="33600" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="true" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="14873" HorzRelTo="Paper" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="14227" VertRelTo="Paper"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><DRAWINGOBJECT><SHAPECOMPONENT GroupLevel="0" HorzFlip="false" InstID="140495137" OriHeight="15000" OriWidth="33600" VertFlip="false" XPos="0" YPos="0"><ROTATIONINFO Angle="0" CenterX="0" CenterY="0" Rotate="1"/><RENDERINGINFO><TRANSMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/></RENDERINGINFO></SHAPECOMPONENT><LINESHAPE Alpha="0" EndCap="Flat" Style="None" Width="33"/><SHADOW Alpha="0" Color="11711154" OffsetX="0" OffsetY="0" Type="0"/><DRAWTEXT Editable="false" LastWidth="33600"><TEXTMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Keep" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="2" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>1. 계곡 등 우수 및 토사유출 경로에서의 개발을 지양할 것.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="2" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>2. 급경사지 및 절개지 인접지역에 개발을 지양할 것.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="2" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>3. 하천ㆍ연안주변 저지대 및 상습침수지역에 위치하는경우</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="2" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>   일정 거리를 이격하였는지를 검토할 것.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="2" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>4. 급경사지 등 산사태 위험지역에 위치하는 경우 일정거리를</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="2" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>   이격 하였는지를 검토 할 것.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="2" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>5. 하천ㆍ연안주변 저지대에 위치하는 배수로, 저류조 등 침수</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="2" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>   방지 시설 설치 유무를 검토 할 것.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="2" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>6. 옹벽 등 경사면에 접한 구조물을 설치하는 경우 배수로 설치</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="2" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>   유무를 검토 할 것.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></DRAWTEXT></DRAWINGOBJECT></RECTANGLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="16275" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="2548"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="1" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="4"><RECTANGLE Ratio="0" X0="0" X1="1500" X2="1500" X3="0" Y0="0" Y1="0" Y2="1500" Y3="1500"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="79" Lock="false" NumberingType="None" ZOrder="158"><SIZE Height="1500" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="1500" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="true" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="48979" HorzRelTo="Paper" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="20977" VertRelTo="Paper"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><DRAWINGOBJECT><SHAPECOMPONENT GroupLevel="0" HorzFlip="false" InstID="140495138" OriHeight="1500" OriWidth="1500" VertFlip="false" XPos="0" YPos="0"><ROTATIONINFO Angle="0" CenterX="0" CenterY="0" Rotate="1"/><RENDERINGINFO><TRANSMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><SCAMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000" E6="0.00000"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00000" E2="0.00000" E3="0.00000" E4="0.00000" E5="1.00000"